  "notes": "Per-site CSS selectors, newest markup first. Bump 'version' when editing: installed extensions fetch this file from the main branch daily and use it if its version is higher than theirs. Sites with empty lists rely on automatic detection. Checked live on 2026-11-15: ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini. Perplexity and the others rely on auto-detection; use 'Copy diagnostics' in the popup to report breakage.",
